变形: $\begin{cases}
 3x+y=m\left(5x+y\right)+n\left(5x+3y\right)\Rightarrow
\begin{cases}
5m+5n=3 \\
m+3n=1 
\end{cases}\Rightarrow
\begin{cases}
m=\frac{2}{5} \\
n=\frac{1}{5} 
\end{cases} \\
\Rightarrow\frac{1}{5x+y}+\frac{1}{5x+3y}=\left(\frac{1}{5x+y}+\frac{1}{5x+3y}\right)\left[\frac{2}{5}\left(5x+y\right)+\frac{1}{5}\left(5x+3y\right)\right] \\
 \text{此时建议结合换元处理结构更简单}
\begin{cases}
5x+y=m \\
5x+3y=n
\end{cases}
\end{cases}$

万能公式：$\begin{cases}
 & \sin x=\frac{\sin x}{1}=\frac{2\sin\frac{x}{2}\cos\frac{x}{2}}{\sin^{2}\frac{x}{2}+\cos^{2}\frac{x}{2}}=\frac{2\tan\frac{x}{2}}{1+\tan^{2}\frac{x}{2}} \\
 & \cos x=\frac{\cos x}{1}=\frac{\cos^{2}\frac{x}{2}-\sin^{2}\frac{x}{2}}{\cos^{2}\frac{x}{2}+\sin^{2}\frac{x}{2}}=\frac{1-\tan^{2}\frac{x}{2}}{1+\tan^{2}\frac{x}{2}} \\
 & \tan x=\frac{2\tan\frac{x}{2}}{1-\tan^{2}\frac{x}{2}}
\end{cases}$

